    {"id":"crimson_shop_intro","context":"绯红精华商店用途","text":"Exchange Crimson Essence for perks useful in the Crimson Isle, Kuudra Boss Fight and beyond!","placeholders":[],"translate":true,"zh":"消耗绯红精华兑换天赋,助你探索绯红岛、挑战 Kuudra 等!","segments":[{"color":"§7","text":"Exchange ","zh":"消耗"},{"color":"§d","text":"Crimson Essence ","zh":"绯红精华"},{"color":"§7","text":"for perks useful in the ","zh":"兑换天赋,助你探索"},{"color":"§c","text":"Crimson Isle","zh":"绯红岛"},{"color":"§7","text":", ","zh":"、"},{"color":"§c","text":"Kuudra Boss Fight","zh":"挑战 Kuudra"},{"color":"§7","text":" and beyond!","zh":"等!"}],"samples":[["§7Exchange §dCrimson Essence §7for","§7perks useful in the §cCrimson Isle§7,","§cKuudra Boss Fight§7 and beyond!"]] },
