    {"id":"crimson_kuudra_master_effect","context":"按本难度或更高难度的最高完成波次计算伤害增幅","text":"Deal %1$s% increased damage to Kuudra's Minions, multiplied by your highest defeated wave in that tier or higher. (Max %2$s%).","placeholders":[{"token":"%1$s","type":"number","example":"0.1","desc":"每波对应的伤害增幅"},{"token":"%2$s","type":"number","example":"10","desc":"伤害增幅上限"}],"gloss":"不是每波当场叠层；使用本难度及更高难度的历史最高完成波次。","translate":true,"zh":"对 Kuudra 仆从造成的伤害提高 %1$s% × 你在当前或更高难度完成的最高波次。(上限 %2$s%)","segments":[{"color":"§7","text":"Deal ","zh":"对 ","order":0},{"color":"§a","text":"%1$s% ","zh":"%1$s% ","order":3},{"color":"§7","text":"increased damage to ","zh":"造成的伤害提高 ","order":2},{"color":"§c","text":"Kuudra's Minions","zh":"Kuudra 仆从","order":1},{"color":"§7","text":", multiplied by your highest defeated wave in that tier or higher. ","zh":"× 你在当前或更高难度完成的最高波次。","order":4},{"color":"§8","text":"(Max %2$s%).","zh":"(上限 %2$s%)","order":5}],"samples":[["§7Deal §a0.1% §7increased damage to","§cKuudra's Minions§7, multiplied by your","§7highest defeated wave in that tier or","§7higher. §8(Max 10%)."]] },
